{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26025","headline":"秋思三首 一 · 鲍溶","name":"秋思三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡风吹鴈翼，远别无人乡。\n君近鴈来处，几回断君肠。\n昔奉千日书，抚心怨星霜。\n无书又千日，世路重茫茫。\n燕国有佳丽，蛾眉富春光。\n自然君归晚，花落君空堂。\n君其若不然，岁晚双鸳鸯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26025.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26025","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}